    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55267" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>placing among the stars</i>:
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καταστερισμοί, οἱ</span>, title of treatise on constellations by
			Hipparchus, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; also of an extant work wrongly attributed to Eratosthenes;
			cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>Epp.</u>
				5.17.1
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i>Aphr.<i><span class="en">
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				833.2
			</span></i>.</div>
